  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The install prompt now waits for an engaged visitor. It shows from the second visit, then after the visitor scrolls 50% of a page or spends 30 seconds on it. Three new options change this: InstallPrompt:MinVisits, InstallPrompt:MinScrollPercent and InstallPrompt:MinSecondsOnPage. Set them to 0 for the old behaviour of showing at once. Also new is ServiceWorker:ImportScripts, a list of root-relative script paths the generated worker loads with importScripts, for push or sync handlers. No other API changes. Full changelog: https://github.com/BaryoDev/umbraco-pwa/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
